WEBVTT

00:17:26.121 --> 00:17:31.871
The question I had is, how do you find
partnerships where there is a thinker

00:17:32.038 --> 00:17:36.871
and then a thinker, or is it always or
typically whether it's one or two

00:17:36.871 --> 00:17:40.704
or more people that are able
to rethink and think,

00:17:40.871 --> 00:17:42.788
oh, that's such a cool question.

00:17:45.038 --> 00:17:49.204
I think my ideal partnership is one where.

00:17:50.538 --> 00:17:54.204
There are clear norms that make
sure rethinking happens.

00:17:55.246 --> 00:17:59.163
The question of where it comes from is
something that I don't have good data

00:17:59.163 --> 00:18:03.329
on, which really mildly annoys me right
now and I need to go gather some.